    - target: {fileID: 790480876947444150, guid: d0f51024171f5ba4a962085d5c5a81d4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'Draw your way out of a sketchpad fantasy!



        Dash Eraser stars
        an aspiring child artist stuck in his own sketchbook come to life. Armed
        with his trusty pencil (and his imagination), our little hero must defend
        himself against all the monsters he drew in class. Featuring fast action
        and over thirty interesting monsters designed by six different artists.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
