      propertyPath: description
      value: 'Tanks In Advance takes a simple 1v1 tank game and adds a time-traveling
        twist! Each round, record your movements as you try to destroy the other
        player''s tanks. Then, in the next round, battle alongside your past selves
        from previous rounds to defeat your opponent.


