    - target: {fileID: 790480876947444150, guid: d0f51024171f5ba4a962085d5c5a81d4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'Game Bytes 2019 features 4 minigames:

        Marble Roller: Roll
        your marble to the end as fast as you can!

        Sporshmallow: Deal as
        much damage as you can with sports themed characters!

        Shotpot: A
        physics based game where you try to grab as much food as you can out of a
        hotpot!

        Tetris 2P: A tetris 1v1 where you defeat the other player
        by clearing grey lines!'
